<article id="pricing">
    <aside></aside>  <!-- spacing -->

    <section class="grid-third">

        <h2 class="right">PRICING</h2>
        <b></b>
        <b></b>

        <div class="index-pricing">
            <h2>100</h2><span>MB</span>
            <p>free forever</p>
        </div>

        <b class="bar xsmall"></b>

        <div class="index-pricing">
            <h2>10</h2><span>GB</span>
            <p class="right">€ 3 / mo</p>
        </div>

        <b class="bar small"></b>

        <div class="index-pricing">
            <h2>400</h2><span>GB</span>
            <p class="right">€ 9 / mo</p>
        </div>

        <b class="bar medium"></b>

        <div class="index-pricing">
            <h2>2000</h2><span>GB</span>
            <p class="right">€ 27 / mo</p>
        </div>

        <b class="bar large"></b>

        <b></b>

        <div id="pricing-note" class="twothird lowercase justify">
            <p>Yes, we're not the cheapest.<br>We could have made our service cheaper too, but;</p>
            <br>
            <ul>
                <li>Cryptee is made in Northern Europe</li>
                <li>It has European design, ethos &amp; quality</li>
                <li>It has European values &amp; privacy protections</li>
                <li>Our team enjoys strong European labor standards</li>
            </ul>
            <br>
            <p>As a small, 100% bootstrapped business, we're sustainable, profitable, and run entirely on subscriptions with no outside investors. Which means no one can ever pressure us to compromise your privacy.</p>

        </div>

        <a href="/signup" id="button-pricing-signup">
            start <span class="hidden-tiny">your journey</span> with the free plan
            <i class="ri-arrow-right-line"></i>
        </a>

    </section>

    <aside></aside>  <!-- spacing -->
</article>
